  "talents_description": {
    "modifier_juggernaut_1_0": "Increase Hits to Destroy your Wards: 1/2",
    "modifier_juggernaut_1_1": "Increase Hits to Destroy your Wards: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/2",
    "modifier_juggernaut_1_2": "Increase Hits to Destroy your Wards: 1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b>",
    "modifier_juggernaut_2_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Totem. \n\n Removes Blade Fury.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Fire Ward \n\n Summons a totem that deals magical damage to nearby enemies and moves at a speed of 325. Explodes upon destruction. Lasts 25 sec.\n\n Damage per Second: 80 + 40%/60%/80% of Strength \n Explosion Damage: 160 + 160%/240%/320% of Strength \n Radius: 400 \n Hits to Destroy: 1",
    "modifier_juggernaut_2_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Totem. \n\n Removes Blade Fury.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Fire Ward</font></b> \n\n Summons a totem that deals magical damage to nearby enemies and moves at a speed of 325. Explodes upon destruction. Lasts 25 sec.\n\n Damage per Second: <b><font color='#eabe10'>80</font></b> + <b><font color='#eabe10'>40%</font></b>/60%/80% of Strength \n Explosion Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>160</font></b> + <b><font color='#eabe10'>160%</font></b>/240%/320% of Strength \n Radius: 400 \n Hits to Destroy: 1",
    "modifier_juggernaut_2_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Totem. \n\n Removes Blade Fury.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Fire Ward</font></b> \n\n Summons a totem that deals magical damage to nearby enemies and moves at a speed of 325. Explodes upon destruction. Lasts 25 sec.\n\n Damage per Second: <b><font color='#eabe10'>80</font></b> + 40%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>60%</font></b>/80% of Strength \n Explosion Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>160</font></b> + 160%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>240%</font></b>/320% of Strength \n Radius: 400 \n Hits to Destroy: 1",
    "modifier_juggernaut_2_3": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Totem. \n\n Removes Blade Fury.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Fire Ward</font></b> \n\n Summons a totem that deals magical damage to nearby enemies and moves at a speed of 325. Explodes upon destruction. Lasts 25 sec.\n\n Damage per Second: <b><font color='#eabe10'>80</font></b> + 40%/60%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>80%</font></b> of Strength \n Explosion Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>160</font></b> + 160%/240%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>320%</font></b> of Strength \n Radius: 400 \n Hits to Destroy: 1",
    "modifier_juggernaut_3_0": "Mana Cost Reduction for Totem Creation: 100% \n\n Totem Movement Speed equals Hero's Movement Speed.",
    "modifier_juggernaut_3_1": "Mana Cost Reduction for Totem Creation: <b><font color='#eabe10'>100%</font></b> \n\n Totem Movement Speed <b><font color='#eabe10'>equals</font></b> Hero's Movement Speed.",
    "modifier_juggernaut_4_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Totem. \n\n Removes Blade Dance.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Wind Ward \n\n Summons a totem that increases allies' attack speed and decreases enemies' attack speed. Moves at a speed of 325. Upon destruction grants an enhanced effect for 2 sec. Lasts 25 sec. \n\n Attack Speed Change: 40/80 \n Attack Speed Change on Destruction: 160/320 \n Radius: 400 \n Attacks to Destroy: 1",
    "modifier_juggernaut_4_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Totem. \n\n Removes Blade Dance.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Wind Ward</font></b> \n\n Summons a totem that increases allies' attack speed and decreases enemies' attack speed. Moves at a speed of 325. Upon destruction grants an enhanced effect for 2 sec. Lasts 25 sec. \n\n Attack Speed Change: <b><font color='#eabe10'>40</font></b>/80 \n Attack Speed Change on Destruction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>160</font></b>/320 \n Radius: 400 \n Attacks to Destroy: 1",
    "modifier_juggernaut_4_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Totem. \n\n Removes Blade Dance.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Wind Ward</font></b> \n\n Summons a totem that increases allies' attack speed and decreases enemies' attack speed. Moves at a speed of 325. Upon destruction grants an enhanced effect for 2 sec. Lasts 25 sec. \n\n Attack Speed Change: 40/<b><font color='#eabe10'>80</font></b> \n Attack Speed Change on Destruction: 160/<b><font color='#eabe10'>320</font></b> \n Radius: 400 \n Attacks to Destroy: 1",
    "modifier_juggernaut_5_0": "Healing Ward Cooldown Reduction: 30 seconds \n\n Healing Ward on Destruction Heals: 10%/20%/30% of Max Health",
    "modifier_juggernaut_5_1": "Healing Ward Cooldown Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>30</font></b> seconds \n\n Healing Ward on Destruction Heals: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b>/20%/30% of Max Health",
    "modifier_juggernaut_5_2": "Healing Ward Cooldown Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>30</font></b> seconds \n\n Healing Ward on Destruction Heals: 10%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b>/30% of Max Health",
    "modifier_juggernaut_5_3": "Healing Ward Cooldown Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>30</font></b> seconds \n\n Healing Ward on Destruction Heals: 10%/20%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>30%</font></b> of Max Health",
    "modifier_juggernaut_6_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Totem. \n\n Removes Omnislash.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Ice Ward \n\n Summons a totem that applies chill to enemies every 5 sec. and moves at a speed of 325. Stuns enemies upon destruction. Lasts 25 sec.\n\n Chill Duration: 0.75/1.5 sec \n Stun Duration: 1.5/3 sec \n Radius: 400 \n Hits to Destroy: 1",
    "modifier_juggernaut_6_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Totem. \n\n Removes Omnislash.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Ice Ward</font></b> \n\n Summons a totem that applies chill to enemies every 5 sec. and moves at a speed of 325. Stuns enemies upon destruction. Lasts 25 sec.\n\n Chill Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>0.75</font></b>/1.5 sec \n Stun Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1.5</font></b>/3 sec \n Radius: 400 \n Hits to Destroy: 1",
    "modifier_juggernaut_6_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Totem. \n\n Removes Omnislash.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Ice Ward</font></b> \n\n Summons a totem that applies chill to enemies every 5 sec. and moves at a speed of 325. Stuns enemies upon destruction. Lasts 25 sec.\n\n Chill Duration: 0.75/<b><font color='#eabe10'>1.5</font></b> sec \n Stun Duration: 1.5/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b> sec \n Radius: 400 \n Hits to Destroy: 1",
    "modifier_juggernaut_7_0": "For the first 4 seconds after being summoned, your Wards are Invulnerable. \n\n Totems are created instantly.",
    "modifier_juggernaut_7_1": "For the first <b><font color='#eabe10'>4</font></b> seconds after being summoned, your Wards are Invulnerable. \n\n Totems are created <b><font color='#eabe10'>instantly</font></b>.",
