    "modifier_juggernaut_16_2": "Blade Fury Increases Movement Speed: 25/<b><font color='#eabe10'>50</font></b>/75 \n\n Blade Fury Slows Enemies: 5%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b>/15%",
    "modifier_juggernaut_16_3": "Blade Fury Increases Movement Speed: 25/50/<b><font color='#eabe10'>75</font></b> \n\n Blade Fury Slows Enemies: 5%/10%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>15%</font></b>",
